# Normalise line endings.
#
# This repo has core.autocrlf=true and, until now, no attributes file. That
# combination rewrites working-tree files to CRLF on any checkout — including
# the one a `git stash pop` performs — while Prettier's endOfLine default is
# "lf". The result was hundreds of phantom `Delete ␍` errors from
# eslint-plugin-prettier on files nobody had edited.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores text as LF in the repository (which is already the
# case) AND checks it out as LF, so the working tree, the blobs and Prettier
# finally agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending-converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
